OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe Royal Scottish National
OL,7,     FOrchestra performs Shostakovich's
OL,8,     FFifth Symphony, and violist
OL,9,     FLawrence Power plays Alfred
OL,10,     FSchnittke's powerful Viola
OL,11,     FConcerto. Conducted by Patrick
OL,12,     FHahn.
OL,13,G2145 The Essay: Three hundred metres in
OL,14,G     Montparnasse
OL,15,     FThe Montparnasse area in Paris has
OL,16,     Fbeen home to generations of the
OL,17,     Fworld's most influential artists.
OL,18,     FResident Joanna Robertson explores
OL,19,     Fthe impact of its land and gardens
OL,20,     Fon them.
